Third-party code and assets
---------------------------
* RikkaHub (https://github.com/rikkahub/rikkahub), AGPL-3.0
  - `workspace/` module: proot launcher, rootfs installer/patcher, workspace file system, pty JNI
  - `highlight/` module: syntax highlighting for Compose
  - The Claude Code session/protocol layer and the workspace file/terminal pages were first written
    inside a fork of RikkaHub ("Min") and moved here.
* PRoot (https://proot-me.github.io/) with Termux patches (https://github.com/termux/proot), GPL-2.0
  - `workspace/src/main/jniLibs/*/libproot_exec.so`, `libproot_loader.so`
* Termux terminal-emulator / terminal-view (https://github.com/termux/termux-app), GPL-3.0
* JetBrains markdown (https://github.com/JetBrains/markdown), Apache-2.0 (rikkahub fork)
* HugeIcons (https://hugeicons.com) stroke set via com.github.rikkahub:hugeicons-compose
* JetBrains Mono font, SIL Open Font License 1.1
* Ubuntu base images are downloaded at runtime from cdimage.ubuntu.com (or a mirror);
  Node.js from nodejs.org; @anthropic-ai/claude-code from registry.npmjs.org.

